      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$ifNull</code> operator. Replacement values can be either <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>field references</code></a>, <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>expressions</code></a>, values of simple MongoDB types or values that can be\nconverted to a simple MongoDB type.",
      "translation": "封装聚合框架中的 `$ifNull` 操作符。替换值可以是 <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>字段引用</code></a>、<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>表达式</code></a>、简单的 MongoDB 类型值，或可转换为简单 MongoDB 类型的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
